[Desktop Entry]
Name=Verso
Comment=Browse, search and organise your Immich photos and videos
Keywords=Immich;photos;videos;gallery;albums;people;
Exec=verso %u
Icon=dev.hviid.Verso
Terminal=false
Type=Application
Categories=Graphics;Photography;Viewer;
StartupNotify=true
# The AppImage's one entry (ARCHITECTURE.md, "Verso as an AppImage"): app.immich is the browser sign-in's redirect, which
# reaches Verso once a tool that adds AppImages to the desktop (Gear Lever, AppImageLauncher) has made this the entry the
# system knows. It announces nothing to Immich Crosslink (https://jakob.hviid.phd/immich-crosslink/): a participant is
# an entry that names a program, and an AppImage's file may move.
MimeType=x-scheme-handler/app.immich;
